        "is_free": false,
        "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3999430/extras/9150d717b85bcbd73b7e2d5fd0e90632.webp?t=1763086039\" width=378 height=58 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Beginning with a broadcast sent directly to your mind, you're then forced into a sinister world full of monsters that hide as shadows on the walls, while your mind melts and the world changes around you. Suit up, its going to be a long week.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3999430/extras/4376bab728965c613b06686f8363f9a6.poster.avif?t=1763086039\" width=818 height=380 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3999430/extras/4376bab728965c613b06686f8363f9a6.webm?t=1763086039\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3999430/extras/1b3315aae06053c3bb50a7b6881c7a05.poster.avif?t=1763086039\" width=720 height=480 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3999430/extras/1b3315aae06053c3bb50a7b6881c7a05.webm?t=1763086039\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><i><strong>Choose your class</strong></i></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Select your class and build your character<i> - Choose between 4 unique classes with unique abilities and stats then build your character as you play</i></strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Brute -</strong> Strength and Power - Smash your way through hallways and let nothing stop you</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Thief -</strong> Relying on speed and agility, with a powerful Dash that can move through objects in your way</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Haggler -</strong> This worlds take on a Mage - Remotely accessing the shop anytime provides a major upper hand</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Journeyman -</strong> Jack of all trades and master of none - The perfect class to carve out the playstyle you seem fitting</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3999430/extras/9e0754393b60fd141aa7dfab3c9a47e8.poster.avif?t=1763086039\" width=1164 height=644 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3999430/extras/9e0754393b60fd141aa7dfab3c9a47e8.webm?t=1763086039\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3999430/extras/9e0754393b60fd141aa7dfab3c9a47e8.mp4?t=1763086039\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\">Every enemy requires a different approach</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">The monsters in this world prefer to not be seen. They hide as shadows on the wall, watching and following you. Some hide as a stool, a box, a statue, and they only move closer when you dont notice them. Some monsters cannot be seen by the naked eye, only be using an old mostly broken camera can you spot where they are when you hear them growling in your ear. And well... one likes to be seen, and will make its presence known.... relentlessly.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3999430/extras/7211560d8acd0aae6cc21cb285338343.poster.avif?t=1763086039\" width=824 height=384 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3999430/extras/7211560d8acd0aae6cc21cb285338343.webm?t=1763086039\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3999430/extras/b0b167c5fc8348b4adfb7fd943a5dd92.poster.avif?t=1763086039\" width=760 height=364 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3999430/extras/b0b167c5fc8348b4adfb7fd943a5dd92.webm?t=1763086039\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3999430/extras/b0b167c5fc8348b4adfb7fd943a5dd92.mp4?t=1763086039\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\">Robust Sanity System</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Your mind may be the biggest threat of all... Keep your sanity meter full before the world warps around you. The further your sanity meter descends, you will see and hear things that may or may not be there, let it drain completely and you'll question everything you see.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3999430/extras/f7b50f92c5a41e6eee700ae524374b27.poster.avif?t=1763086039\" width=854 height=480 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3999430/extras/f7b50f92c5a41e6eee700ae524374b27.webm?t=1763086039\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\">Feel overpowered while underpowered</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Grind your stats and you will have every advantage - speed, strength, money, mental fortitude... But don't forget these entities don't abide by the laws of physics.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\">Trial and Error</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Every run is a desperate descent into procedurally generated dungeons where nothing stays the same for long. Time is limited—you have only <strong>five days</strong> to complete your objective. As you run out of resources, and the entities who have occupied these facilities seem to enjoy </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Failure is inevitable, but not meaningless. Death, madness, and repetition feed into a larger cycle of growth. Survive, adapt, and carve your own path forward—if you can keep your grip on reality.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
